# The global git ignore (~/.config/git/ignore) hides all .claude/ dirs — that's
# right for the stray per-project settings Claude Code drops everywhere. But we
# DO want to version the one global CLAUDE.md, so re-include just its dir + file.
!claude/.claude/
!claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md
